---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import site from '../data/site.json';
---
<Base title="The Decision Toolkit | Leadership Frameworks by Jack P. Flaherty"
  description="The Clear Confidence Assessment shows where your decision process breaks down before a crisis makes it obvious. About five minutes, results to your inbox."
  path="/decision-making-toolkit" image="/images/jack-p-flaherty-teaching-whiteboard.jpg">

  <section class="dark">
    <div class="wrap split rev">
      <div>
        <h1>The Clear Confidence Assessment: find out where your decision process breaks</h1>
        <p class="lede" style="color:#E3D5BE">Drowning in data? Do decisions still feel like a guess?</p>
        <p>You do not need more information. You need a cleaner process.</p>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/jack-p-flaherty-teaching-whiteboard.jpg" alt="Jack P. Flaherty teaching at a whiteboard" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap split">
      <img src="/images/jack-p-flaherty-workshop-table.jpg" alt="Jack P. Flaherty leading a workshop at a table" width="1600" height="1199" loading="lazy" />
      <div>
        <h2>Most leaders do not have a decision problem. They have a structure problem.</h2>
        <p>After 25 years in risk and advisory, 15 of them at the Big Four, watching capable teams stall at the exact moment it counted, Jack built a method to move leaders from analysis to action without skipping the steps that protect them.</p>
        <p>This assessment is built from that method. It takes about five minutes. It shows where your decision process breaks down before a crisis makes it obvious.</p>
        <p>It examines three areas every high-stakes choice depends on:</p>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li><b>Logic vs. Intuition:</b> Where are you over-analyzing, and where are you under-thinking?</li>
          <li><b>Risk &amp; Bias:</b> What are you missing that a more objective read would catch?</li>
          <li><b>Context &amp; Agility:</b> When pressure is real, do you move, or do you wait for certainty that never arrives?</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Your results go straight to your inbox, with a practical read on where your decision process is solid and where it needs reinforcement.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>What changes when your leaders decide faster?</h2>
      <div class="grid c3">
        <div class="card accent"><h3>Clarity</h3><p>See exactly where the "Certainty Trap" is stalling your progress and where your decision-making is already elite.</p></div>
        <div class="card accent"><h3>Momentum</h3><p>Get a personalized roadmap to bridge the gap between heavy data and sharp intuition so you can move faster.</p></div>
        <div class="card accent"><h3>Confidence</h3><p>Start leading from a place of absolute conviction, compelling others to follow, knowing you've identified risks others missed.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap split">
      <img src="/images/jack-p-flaherty-advisory-conversation.jpg" alt="Jack P. Flaherty in a confidential advisory conversation" width="1600" height="876" loading="lazy" />
      <div>
        <h2>Take the Clear Confidence Assessment</h2>
        <p>Your results are sent straight to your inbox, with the first moves to make your next technology decision with confidence.</p>
        <p>Your decision process either works under pressure or it does not.</p>
        <p>This assessment tells you which.</p>
        <a class="btn" href={site.assessment} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Take the assessment</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta-band">
        <h2>Read the thinking behind the method</h2>
        <p>Short pieces on making decisions with technology, for health-system leaders, partners and the boards they answer to. Start with Fear Is Not A Control and Treat New Technology Like a New Hire.</p>
        <div class="btns" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:.4rem"><a class="btn" href="/insights">Go to Insights</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dark">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>When decisions matter most</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="color:#E3D5BE">Your team needs more than a strategy session. They need a method they can run themselves.</p>
      <div class="btns"><a class="btn light" href={site.calendly} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a discovery call</a></div>
      <p style="margin-top:1.6rem">The cost of uninformed and delayed decisions compounds quickly.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta-band">
        <h2>Where does your decision-making actually stand?</h2>
        <p>Find out in about 3 minutes and get a personalized report.</p>
        <div class="btns" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:.4rem"><a class="btn" href={site.assessment} target="_blank" rel="noopener">See where you stand</a></div>
        <p class="meta" style="margin-top:1rem">Free. No call required.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

